<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Sons of Gwalia sees A$60 mln surplus.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Sons of Gwalia sees A$60 mln surplus.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold miner Sons of Gwalia Ltd said on Friday a restructuring of its existing hedge book would generate surplus cash funds of A$60 million.</p>
</text>
